WEBVTT

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:36.930
<i>ENTER THE RED DOORS</i>

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:57.530
<i>Up above the forest of slumber</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:04.160
<i>Two moons look down from the sky</i>

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:11.670
<i>Where did you come from,</i>
<i>and where are you going?</i>

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:20.050
<i>Where are we going?</i>

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:25.730
<i>ENTER THE RED DOORS</i>

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:37.280
Kill... Kill... Kill...

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:40.870
Kill... Kill... Kill...

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:43.200
Kill... Kill...

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.370
Oh, sorry...

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.790
Kill!

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:48.750
He's got a knife!

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:51.340
--Run away!
--Kill... Kill... Kill...

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:53.550
N-No...!

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:55.170
Kill!

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:11.110
Rin, pyo, to, sha,
kai, jin, retsu, zai, zen.

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:13.860
Kyu, kyu, nyo, ritsu, ryo--
Evil begone!

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:37.260
"On-you Utsushiyo Ayakashi Harai"

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:44.810
"Curses Return Upon the Casters"

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:52.940
"You suck! You suck! You suck!
You suck! You suck! You suck!"

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:53.440
"Die! Die! Die! Die! Die! Die!"

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:54.190
"Die! Die! Die! Die! Die! Die!"
"Your very existence is annoying!!"

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:55.270
"Die! Die! Die! Die! Die! Die!"
"Your very existence is annoying!!"
"Stop sucking up the air in our room! Idiot!"

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:04.200
The cursed words just keep coming.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:09.040
I wonder if the phrase
"curses return upon the casters" is true?

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:10.250
The inconvenience fee.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.880
Come on, cough it up.

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:16.380
Or would you rather we spread this around?

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:17.670
Hurry up and steal it.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:20.340
If you don't hurry, they'll see you.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.720
Come on.

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:39.690
Aww, my hand slipped.

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:41.490
Kasumin, you're so mean.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:43.950
Natsuki's gonna cry.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:47.950
Is doing all this really fun for you guys?

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:50.910
What's with those eyes? You're pissing me off.

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:52.160
Pick it up!

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:56.460
Pick it up!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:04:04.090
Pick it up! Pick it up! Pick it up! Pick it up!

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:09.260
Oh, how dirty!

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:11.680
Then, I'll clean her up with this!

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.190
Good idea.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:16.560
It's not getting her clean at all.

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:18.980
Because she was filthy to begin with!

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:24.320
I wish break time would hurry up and end.

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:32.960
"Gross"
"Die"
"Idiot"

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:47.260
"Pee-yew"

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.840
It's hard for anyone to
play it off on my textbook...

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:52.640
I'm home...

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:14.660
Kyu, kyu, nyo, ritsu, ryo--
Evil begone!

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:25.840
The last episode of <i>On-Bara</i> was so cool!

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:33.350
"Die! Die! Die! Die! Die!"
"Gross! Gross! Gross! Gross! Gross!"

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:34.100
"Die! Die! Die! Die! Die!"
"Gross! Gross! Gross! Gross! Gross!"
"Stay away from school!"

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:34.600
"Gross! Gross! Gross! Gross! Gross!"
"Stay away from school!"
"Ugly! Ugly! Ugly! Ugly! Ugly!"

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:35.230
"Stay away from school!"
"Ugly! Ugly! Ugly! Ugly! Ugly!"
"Get lost! Get lost! Get lost!"

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:43.030
That's enough for today... I'm tired...

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.200
Where am I...?

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:36.660
Is this the world after death?

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:43.170
Huh?

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:44.340
No way!

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.390
Wow, I've turned into Haruyoshi!

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:55.560
The cosplay's perfect!

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:00.100
Wow, it's just like the show!

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:03.400
What is this, an <i>On-Bara</i> theme park?!

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:05.900
These!

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:08.860
These are the wishes the client
wrote in episode three!

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:12.160
That's the tree that was hit
by lightning in episode eight!

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:15.280
Here it is! This is the angle!

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.500
Huh?

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:22.830
Oh yeah!

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:28.050
Rin, pyo, to, sha,
kai, jin, retsu, zai, zen!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:29.340
Kyu, kyu, nyo, ritsu, ryo--

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:30.840
Evil begone!

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:41.350
Wow, it's the real thing!

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:44.150
The afterlife is the best!

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:45.940
Wh-What?

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:47.570
How cute!

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:53.570
There's a monster!

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:56.740
Rin, pyo, to, sha,
kai, jin, retsu, zai, zen!

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:59.580
Kyu, kyu, nyo, ritsu, ryo--
Evil begone!

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.790
All right!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:11.090
Kyu, kyu, nyo, ritsu, ryo--
Evil begone!

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:17.810
Evil begone!

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:23.020
Evil begone!

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:31.570
Evil begone!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:43.410
No one's here... Just monsters...

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:46.170
Am I just supposed to do this forever?

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:49.500
Tomorrow, and the day after...?

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:52.420
For a year? For ten years?

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:52.590
"You suck! You suck! You suck!"

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:52.920
"You suck! You suck! You suck!"
"Die! Die! Die! Die! Die! Die!"

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:53.420
"Pee-yew"

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:56.260
"Die!"

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:04.140
Even though I decided... that I would
never cry because of you guys...

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:10.480
Why...? Why did this happen?

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:39.760
Why me?

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:45.060
I won't forgive you.

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:47.600
I won't forgive you!

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.490
I'll never forgive you!

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:07.670
Hm? Group nightmares...

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:12.000
"Group nightmares at metro
middle school increasing?!"

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:13.630
"At Musashi-Tama Middle School, more and more
students are having nightmares for no reason..."

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:20.220
Momo...

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.890
Momo...

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:23.640
Momo...

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.180
Momo...

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:26.560
Momo...

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:30.520
Why are you alive?

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:35.940
Hey, Sakurai, were you sleeping?

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:38.070
Oh, it was just a dream.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:52.080
Teacher, I feel sick.
Can I go to the nurse's office?

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:56.460
All right. Then, Class Rep, you go with her.

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.930
Momo...

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:06.470
N-No...!

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:18.110
I won't forgive you...

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:19.950
I won't forgive you...

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:20.990
No!

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:26.080
I won't forgive you... I won't forgive you...

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.120
I won't forgive you...

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.750
I won't ever forgive you.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:36.880
Look out!

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:39.880
Are you all right?

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:43.680
H-Help me...

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:44.890
Huh?

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:51.730
Feeling a little calmer?

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:56.650
Th-Thanks.

00:11:56.650 --> 00:12:00.530
You wouldn't happen to be a student
at Musashi-Tama Middle School?

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:04.200
If you are, then there's something
I'd like you to tell me.

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:08.830
Do you know anything
about the group nightmares?

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:10.000
Huh?

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:17.250
In other words, after this girl named Natsuki
Kamikawa attempted to kill herself,

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:22.050
everyone in the group that bullied her
started having the nightmares...

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:26.640
That's not all. Even our homeroom teacher
and classmates from outside that group

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:28.260
have started having nightmares.

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:30.560
Are all the nightmares the same?

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:33.390
They're a little different
depending on the person.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:37.110
But everyone seems to be being chased
by Natsuki or someone else...

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:41.530
And do you know how
Natsuki's doing right now?

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:44.950
No! She hasn't been to school since then!

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:48.450
People have been saying that
maybe she really did die...

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:57.710
Huh?

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:04.260
"Natsuki Kamikawa"

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.720
Miku!

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:10.220
Miku...

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:15.310
Forgive us already, Natsuki!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:23.740
I want you to try diving into the dream
of a girl named Natsuki.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.490
Starting with the group of girls
who bullied her,

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:28.990
more and more people have
started to have nightmares.

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:31.410
Aren't they just getting what they deserve?

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:35.960
It's not just them--the nightmares
are spreading on a larger scale,

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:40.340
and there's a chance that the whole group might
come down with Sleeping Beauty Syndrome.

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:50.600
You're sure this is the right way?

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:51.600
Probably.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:52.720
Probably--?

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:00.730
That was a close one.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:01.820
Behind you!

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:06.490
Whew, you saved me.

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:10.370
It doesn't look like we're very welcome here.

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:15.870
--Let's go!
--Yeah!

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:16.660
Hurry!

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:18.330
I <i>am</i> hurrying!

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:29.970
We should be safe this far away.

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:35.770
This is the place.

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:43.820
May calamity be visited upon Kasumi Fukumoto.

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:46.900
May calamity be visited upon Mei Asakura.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.990
May calamity be visited upon Momoka Sakurai.

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:52.530
Could we... have a word with you?

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:53.410
Who are you?

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:56.000
Tsukishiro. Haruto Tsukishiro.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:58.750
I'm Katsumi Kanzaki.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:02.130
You can't fool me.
You're just more phantoms, aren't you?!

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.840
We're no phantoms!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:08.550
Could we ask you to stop the curses?
At the rate you're going,

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:12.220
all of your classmates and
everyone in town will be brought down.

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:13.760
Brought down?

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:17.350
You mean that my curses are working?

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:18.430
Yeah, which is why--

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:19.890
Then I'll curse them!

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:22.350
I'll curse them to death!

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:26.480
People who are unreasonably mean
to others, ostracize them,

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:30.740
and throw them under the bus,
even when they've done nothing wrong,

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:33.160
can just disappear from this world.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:36.240
It's because of things like witch hunts
and racial discrimination

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:39.040
that war has yet to be
done away with in our world.

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:41.460
Tell me, what worth do people like that have?

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:45.210
Yes, but it's affecting your classmates
that weren't involved in the bullying, too.

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:47.800
Weren't involved?! They're still guilty!

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:52.090
It's gutless to know that bullying is going on
and pretend not to see it!

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:56.810
True enough. It's the same
as pitching in to the bullying.

00:15:56.810 --> 00:16:02.480
But still, nobody gets to decide
that they aren't worth anything, do they?

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:07.320
You yourself have worth
that's only of value to you.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:10.900
You don't know anything about me!
Watch what you're saying!

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:16.740
I know that you work hard--
even <i>too</i> hard sometimes.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.540
It must have been tough.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.410
I'll bet it all turned out like this

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:27.920
because you were so serious, and kind,
and always tried your hardest.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:32.930
I think that's a terrific show of your "worth."

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:34.800
It is?

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:38.760
Not to mention that there are people
worried about you, Natsuki.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:43.520
Your mother sobbed that she
was sorry she didn't notice.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.270
Momoka also apologized in earnest.

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:47.480
No way.

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:08.880
Thank you.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:16.890
But... it's already too late.

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:21.310
W-What's that?!

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:26.270
The invasion fleet from Centauri Alpha
has landed on Earth.

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:31.230
Heh. In that case, we just have to
resist them in our giant robot!

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:34.280
Robot? Don't you mean your space battleship?

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.530
Ready to go?

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:38.160
Of course!

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.660
Put them on the main monitor!

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.290
That is one huge fleet.

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:46.790
Scramble fighters!

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:47.830
Roger!

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:55.550
Kind of lacking a sense of cosplay here, huh?

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:06.310
Unit 1, engage!

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:11.650
Unit 2, engage!

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.150
Brother!

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:18.240
Wh-What's she doing here?

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:21.990
Emergency launch. To avoid danger,
please do not leave your classroom.

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:25.000
Repeat, emergency launch.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:27.540
To avoid danger,
please do not leave your classroom.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:34.300
Haruto deploying!

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:35.340
Go!

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:37.010
Natsuki moving out!

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:49.900
Linking up!

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:51.110
Roger!

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:12.380
Ooh, I'm on fire! Giant Robot Natsuking!

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:13.380
Nat--?

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:14.920
Great name, right?

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:17.380
N-Not bad, I guess.

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:20.630
Let's go, Natsuking!

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:34.570
First, we give these guys a quick boot!

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:35.440
Acknowledged!

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:36.190
Here we go!

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:38.900
Natsukick!

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:46.200
Natsukick!

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:01.760
There's no end to them.
At this point, we need our finishing blow!

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:02.840
I've been waiting for this!

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:03.800
Here we go!

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:08.890
Special attack! Beam from the eyes!

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:25.780
That's a nice smile.

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:27.740
Wh-Where is that suddenly coming from?

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:30.660
You're quite the otaku, aren't you?

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:33.250
You were pretty into it yourself, "Uncle."

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:35.960
I'm nobody's "Uncle"! I'm a "Brother"!

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:41.170
Still, it's been a long time
since I've had any fun.

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:46.680
I wish I could have met
someone like you before I died.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.220
Before you died?

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:53.770
This isn't the afterlife. Natsuki,
you have Sleeping Beauty Syndrome.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:57.560
Huh? Sleeping Beauty Syndrome? You mean...

00:20:57.560 --> 00:20:59.610
The illness where you stay asleep.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:04.070
Then, does that mean I'm alive?

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:09.540
I can get out of here then?

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:12.250
That part depends on you.

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:17.670
On whether you're ready to face
living in your harsh reality.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:19.340
I <i>am</i> ready.

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:23.170
Thank you.

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:26.010
Farewell.

00:23:05.990 --> 00:23:06.150
"Ugly! Ugly! Ugly! Ugly! Ugly!"
"Down on your knees and apologize!"
"You're the absolute worst!"

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:06.650
"Down on your knees and apologize!"
"You're the absolute worst!"
"This isn't bullying; it's a crime!!"

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:07.360
"You're the absolute worst!"
"This isn't bullying; it's a crime!!"
"Why don't you get lost!"

00:23:07.360 --> 00:23:07.990
"This isn't bullying; it's a crime!!"
"Why don't you get lost!"
"Get off the planet lol"

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:12.120
What are we going to do, Mei?
We can't go to school, can we?

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:15.410
Huh? This is all on <i>me</i>?
Miku, you picked on her, too!

00:23:15.410 --> 00:23:17.620
S-Stop, already!

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:21.250
"Get lost! Get lost! Get lost!"
"You're through as people!"
"Ugly! Ugly! Ugly! Ugly! Ugly!"

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:21.920
"You're through as people!"
"Ugly! Ugly! Ugly! Ugly! Ugly!"
"Down on your knees and apologize!"

00:23:28.300 --> 00:23:34.140
If you were the king of some country,
what would you want to protect?

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:35.930
What would it be, baa?!

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:41.570
"And Now There Are None..."

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:41.570
Next time's dream is
"And Now There Are None..."
